                <svg class="sa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="sa-faq-answer">
                Yes. Knockio is the ideal SPOTIO alternative for sales and service businesses. It provides the same robust territory mapping and live rep tracking, but natively includes the back-office tools (dispatching, estimates, and billing) that SPOTIO lacks.
              </div>
            </details>
